  "details": "I previously thought it was just due to the increase load from being in the heavy instances during Furality but it’s still affecting me even in small instances and it also happened to a friend of mine earlier when it was just me and them and they’re also on the open beta and they also very rarely crash these days as well. \n\nI suspect something very odd is happening under the hood of the client that’s causing these crashes. Although I've been told it's also an everyone issue and there have been issues with mem leaks and other things, figured I'd create a canny just incase something could be going on.\n\noutput log: https://files.catbox.moe/la9ows.zip",
